	)

	(text "Place here:\n  • J2: GCT USB4105-GF-A or Amphenol 12401610E412A — 24-pin mid-mount USB-C receptacle\n  • R10: 22 kΩ 1% 0402 — CC1 to +5V (Rp, source role, 1.5 A advertisement)\n  • R11: 22 kΩ 1% 0402 — CC2 to +5V (Rp, source role, 1.5 A advertisement)\n  • U9: NUP4202W1T1G (or PRTR5V0U2X) — ESD array on SS pair and D+/D-\n        Place as close to J2 as possible, upstream of any trace branching\n  • C15: 100 nF X7R 0402 — AC-coupling on USB_SSTX+ (TX pair only, between Sheet 04 and J2)\n  • C16: 100 nF X7R 0402 — AC-coupling on USB_SSTX- (TX pair only, between Sheet 04 and J2)\n  • F1: 2 A / 6 V PPTC resettable fuse — in series with VBUS before J2 VBUS pins\n        Bourns MF-MSMF200/33X-2 or TE MICROSMD200F-2 (1206 footprint)\n  • C11: 22 µF / 10 V X5R 1210 — VBUS bulk (after F1, at J2 pads)\n  • C12: 22 µF / 10 V X5R 1210 — VBUS bulk\n  • C13: 22 µF / 10 V X5R 1210 — VBUS bulk\n  • C14: 100 nF / 16 V X7R 0402 — VBUS high-frequency bypass\n\nConnector pin map (USB-C 24-pin, per USB 3.2 spec):\n  TX1+ A2, TX1- A3      → USB_SSTX+, USB_SSTX-  (SuperSpeed TX, single orientation)\n  RX1+ B10, RX1- B11   → USB_SSRX+, USB_SSRX-  (SuperSpeed RX, single orientation)\n  TX2+ A10, TX2- A11   → NC  (add explicit No-Connect flags)\n  RX2+ B2,  RX2- B3    → NC  (add explicit No-Connect flags)\n  D+   A6              → USB_DP  (short A6 and B6 at connector pads for 2.0 reversibility)\n  D+   B6              → USB_DP  (shorted at pad)\n  D-   A7              → USB_DM  (short A7 and B7 at connector pads for 2.0 reversibility)\n  D-   B7              → USB_DM  (shorted at pad)\n  CC1  A5              → R10 → +5V\n  CC2  B5              → R11 → +5V\n  SBU1 A8, SBU2 B8     → NC  (add explicit No-Connect flags)\n  VBUS A4, A9, B4, B9  → F1 → +5V rail  (all four VBUS pins bussed together)\n  GND  A1, A12, B1, B12 → GND  (all four GND pins bussed together)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 22.86 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001001")
