	(text "──── ROUTE NOTES ────\n• USB_SSTX± (TX pair): 90 Ω diff; route from Sheet 04 entry through C15/C16 to J2 TX1+/-\n  Length-match within 0.1 mm intra-pair; max 2 vias; no stubs; reference solid GND plane\n• USB_SSRX± (RX pair): 90 Ω diff; route J2 RX1+/- directly toward Sheet 04; no AC caps on RX\n• USB_DP, USB_DM: 90 Ω diff; route to J2 A6/B6 and A7/B7; short both A and B pads at connector\n• VBUS: tie J2 pins A4, A9, B4, B9 together; place F1 (PPTC) in series between +5V rail and this node\n  Place bulk caps C11–C14 at the VBUS node, within 3 mm of J2 pads\n• R10, R11 (CC pull-ups): place within 5 mm of J2 CC1, CC2 pins\n• ESD array U9: place as close to J2 as possible, upstream of trace branching\n• TX2/RX2/SBU pins: mark with explicit No-Connect flags to silence ERC\n• VCONN: not supplied — no e-marked cable needed"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
